# Holding South past the long-press time (500 ms) presses C; letting go earlier taps A.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Gestures
press south
advance 499
release south
advance 400
press south
advance 501
release south
advance 100
---
key KEY_A down @749
key KEY_A up   @749
key KEY_C down @1399
key KEY_C up   @1400
